# Verifying a change

Full guide: @.claude/skills/verify-changes/SKILL.md

- Order: `pnpm type-check` → `pnpm lint` → `pnpm test:run` → `pnpm test:e2e:chrome` if
  user-facing.
- The Vite dev server can't verify extension behavior — `chrome.*` is undefined there. Use
  `pnpm build` and load `build/` unpacked in `chrome://extensions`.
- `pnpm test:e2e:firefox` only proves the extension loads.
- Some test files are excluded in `configs/vitest.config.ts` and never run; if you touch code
  they cover, run them explicitly.
